            <creation xml:id="creation_id11234597">
               <date isodate="1888-11" xml:id="date_b9b644d1">December 1888</date>
               <geogName xml:id="geogName_idb62121a3"/>
            </creation>
            <history xml:id="history_id054792d7">
               <p xml:id="idm115">The German pianist and composer Adolf Henselt was a court pianist in St. Petersburg from 1838 until his death in 1889. This Chanson danoise, which like (NWGW 129) is a paraphrase on the song "Kong Valdemars Jagt" (NWGW 300), was probably a musical greeting on the occasion of Henselt's 50th anniversary as court pianist.</p>
            </history>
